keywords Gnomeregan, Dun Morogh, Orgrimmar, Nogg, Sovik, Scooty, Booty Bay, Goblin Transponder, Kernobee, Sparklematic, Rig Wars, Thermaplugg, Grubbis, Viscous Fallout, Electrocutioner, Crowd Pummeler, ring, dungeon
