why Every Horde quest of Gnomeregan in one run.

# Gnomeregan's Horde quests in one guide: Nogg and Sovik in Orgrimmar,
# Scooty in Booty Bay, one run through the city, then the hand-ins. Steps
# already done are passed over, so the guide picks up wherever the chain
# stands.
#
# The quests: Nogg's 2841 Rig Wars (the Rig Blueprints from Thermaplugg's
# Safe and Thermaplugg's Safe Combination); Sovik's 2842 Chief Engineer Scooty
# -> 2843 Gnomer-gooooone! (the Goblin Transponder). Inside: Kernobee's 2904 A
# Fine Mess (an escort, for Scooty); the Sparklematic 5200's 2951 and 2952;
# the Grime-Encrusted Ring (item 9326, from the Dark Iron Agents) starts 2945,
# handed in at the Sparklematic -> 2949 Return of the Ring -> Nogg's 2950
# Nogg's Ring Redo.
#
# Left out: 4601, 4602, 4605 and 4606, the Sparklematic quests of the city's
# other two machines (alternatives to 2951 and 2952); 2953, 4603 and 4604 More
# Sparklematic Action (repeatable); 80325 The Mad King, which has no giver in
# the data.
#
# Inside: nothing in the data places the bosses, Kernobee, the machines or
# the safe inside, so their goals stand at the door (@24.3,39.8, Dun Morogh)
# with `group 5`. The bosses come in the order of the client's dungeon journal
# (Grubbis, Viscous Fallout, Electrocutioner 6000, Crowd Pummeler 9-60,
# Mekgineer Thermaplugg), not of a recorded run. Every quest goal is counted
# by the quest log, so a group that takes them in another order still gets
# each step ticked. Gnomeregan is in Dun Morogh, Alliance land.
#
# Sources (facts only):
# - Quests, NPCs, items, objects and rewards: Polestar's reference data
#   (data/forever, built from QuestieDB Forever 1.1.4) and Polestar 0.4.1.1's
#   Codex page for the dungeon. The Sparklematic wants three silver coins, as
#   2951's text says; Nogg thirty, as 2950's says. The ring drops from the
#   Dark Iron Agents (35% in the data).
# - The door: QuestieDB's list of Forever's dungeons, as Polestar's Codex holds it
#   (data/codex/entrances.json).
# - The dungeon's size, levels and bosses: the client's group finder and
#   dungeon journal, as Polestar's Codex page holds them (five players, levels
#   29 to 38).
# - Lint warns that the door is more than 50 yards from the grime objects'
#   droppers outside the city; the goal stays at the door for the ones inside.
# INGAME: where inside do Kernobee, the Sparklematic 5200 and Thermaplugg's
#   Safe stand?

step Nogg
  tip In Orgrimmar.
  accept 2841

step Sovik
  accept 2842

step Scooty
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip In Booty Bay.
  turnin 2842
  accept 2843

step Gnomer-gooooone!
  tip Wait for Scooty to calibrate the Goblin Transponder.
  talk 7853 quest 2843.1
  turnin 2843

step To Gnomeregan
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip A dungeon for five players of level 29 to 38, in Dun Morogh: Alliance land.
  enter "Gnomeregan" @24.3,39.8

step The ring
  along until leave
  collect 9326 @24.3,39.8 optional -- The Grime-Encrusted Ring, if a Dark Iron Agent drops it.

step Kernobee
  tip Escort him to the Clockwerk Run exit.
  accept 2904 @24.3,39.8
  complete 2904 @24.3,39.8 group 5

step The Grime-Encrusted Ring
  when has 9326
  accept 2945

step The Sparklematic 5200
  tip The machine's quest comes first: a Grime-Encrusted Object only drops while it is in your log.
  accept 2951 @24.3,39.8

step A Grime-Encrusted Object
  tip Grubbis, the Dark Iron Ambassador and the city's foes drop them.
  collect 9308 quest 2951.1 @24.3,39.8 group 5

step The Sparklematic 5200
  tip Have three silver coins to start the machine.
  money 3s
  turnin 2951 @24.3,39.8
  accept 2952 @24.3,39.8
  turnin 2952 @24.3,39.8

step The Sparklematic 5200
  when onquest 2945
  turnin 2945 @24.3,39.8

step The Sparklematic 5200
  when turnedin 2945
  accept 2949 @24.3,39.8

step Mekgineer Thermaplugg
  tip The last boss in the client's journal, after Grubbis, Viscous Fallout, Electrocutioner 6000 and Crowd Pummeler 9-60. He drops his Safe Combination; the Rig Blueprints are in Thermaplugg's Safe.
  collect 9299 quest 2841.2 @24.3,39.8 group 5
  collect 9153 quest 2841.1 @24.3,39.8 group 5

step Before you leave
  label leave
  tip Leave once the ring has turned up, or you have given up on it.
  collect 9299 quest 2841.2 @24.3,39.8 group 5

step Scooty
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  turnin 2904

step Nogg
  zone Orgrimmar
  turnin 2841

step Nogg
  when onquest 2949
  turnin 2949

step Nogg
  when turnedin 2949
  accept 2950

step Nogg's Ring Redo
  when onquest 2950
  tip Nogg wants a Silver Bar, a Moss Agate and thirty silver coins with the ring.
  auction 2842 x1
  auction 1206 x1
  money 30s

step Nogg
  when onquest 2950
  turnin 2950
